<title>DENMARK: Lauritzen buys gas tankers from Hyundai.</title>
<headline>Lauritzen buys gas tankers from Hyundai.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipbuilding and shipping group J.Lauritzen A/S said on Monday it had placed contracts with South Korea's Hyundai Heavy Industries or two modern, semi-refrigerated gas tanker ships for delivery in September and November 1998.</p>
<p>Lauritzen said that the vessels' engines and other subsidiary machinery would be delivered by European suppliers with advanced gas sections designed by Edinburgh-based Liquid Gas Equipment.</p>
<p>The ships are for Lauritzen's Kosan Tankers unit. Both Lauritzen and Hyundai agreed not to unveil details of the price of the order. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
